Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll carry on till we see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through, believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.64,0:02:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers. Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now an ingress has crooked evil\Nfood money because wasted on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But that explosion is still a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know who caused that mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it was Straw Hat and his allies\Nsince they were on the roof as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They were as likely to\Nkill themselves as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Anna, there is no mystery that's\Nbeen solved during the tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All lines of communication\Nto the venue were
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,jumped and I couldn't\Nfigure out the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was probably orchestrated by\NPetty and his allies. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't the chicken man want\Nto report something, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, oi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Some troubling news about the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They were stationed on the East\NCoast, but so done all the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They took off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The bunch of backstabbing\Nlittle cowards ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Back homes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw them packing up myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They went back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains Chimbe's\Nactions at least. Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At the tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe stared Mama down,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,quit the Big Mom Pirates, and said\Nhe was joining the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he planning that all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why his crew left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew Mama would take\Nout her anger on his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When Jinbei's first attempt\Nto leave didn't go well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,he said he'd stick around to\Ngive his friends time to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the kind of thoughtful\Nstrategy you would expect from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, our troops are already chasing\Ndown Straw Hat and Buggy as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We sent a detached force, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're invading German.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Rulé, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have to ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming we're going to kill Straw\NHat and his friends, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make them pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They abused me like some\Nsort of pack animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They even used me in\Ntheir scheme to kill Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the indignity I suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take Straw Hat's head personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to be eliminated quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If we let him survive, he may become\Nan even greater threat to Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to get out of the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Run as fast and far as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, run? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am telling you, just get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't reach Lord Judge or\NMaster Ichichi on the snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are the Big Mom Pirates here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Her hunger pangs have come back already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The last one was the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to live like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She never got to eat cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as she remembered that,\Nshe must have gone out of her mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's got someone in her hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Opera!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me\NMama stole your lifespan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He chose to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was his atonement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But we need to make sure we\Ndon't suffer the same fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just stand\Nhere and take our legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be coming after us soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to ride on Jinbe\Nand boss us around, lazy thump.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop griping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nani can do whatever she wants,\Nbecause she's cute. Very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicate, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As Nami said, pursuers will surely find\Nus, so we must break haste. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,i know a trick just keep going straight\Nif we cut through the seducing woods
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be back at the sunny in no time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,at all you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,all know
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,what to do the only
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to stop Mama's rampage is to\Ngive her whatever food she's craving!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We need wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the head chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who can make a\Ncake as impressive as the last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, uh, that's gonna be tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Struzan saved everyone's life with\Nhis ability, but when he came down,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he screwed up the landing, big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry he's going to\Nneed several days to recover
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to come up with a new\Nplan before sweet city is destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no stopping\Nmama when she's like this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just let her\Nrampage through the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? He's got a\Nplan. He'll save us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you can always count\Non pedos Patty Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding cake you seek,\Nit's not actually gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, more accurately, we take\Nthe second one just in case. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Press, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made from only the\Nfinest ingredients, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you lick your lips\Nat the very sight of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the greatest cake\Nthe world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted you to have\Nit, but wouldn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those insufferable Straw Hats\Nstole it in the lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're heading to the\Nsouthwest coast trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A lickety-fiasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:11:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They have my wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the Straw\NHat's took it, Elik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she understands\Nme to some extent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If she goes after Straw Hat, it's\Nlike killing two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he really gonna pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are lying you'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I won't\Ntake your lifespan, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have my cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma, mamma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma, mamma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am in for it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if mama does wipe out the straw\Nhats, the cake I promised isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a lick of hope; I'm as good\Nas dead, but you bought some time at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to find someone to make\Nthat cake, otherwise we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're licked then—think\Nabout this for a sec—would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Struzan is obviously our best chef by far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And it took him days\Nto complete that cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,of the rare ingredients we acquired\Nin our raids are all used up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:13:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With Struzan still in a coma, there's\Nno one else who can bake the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama never
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,even tasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we must create the\Nperfect cake from her imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,her imagination What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If she doesn't get the cake\Nshe's built up in her head,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will reject it and\Ncontinue to rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can make such a fantastical creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, it seems this\Nisland is doomed to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What lies beyond that is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything I can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Love the dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't notice, the\Nwedding cake was chocolate chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to chocolate, I'm\Nevery bit as good as the head chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it comes to chiffon cakes,\Nour sister lives up to her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If we team up, then we\Ncan make the perfect cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but chiffon's our enemy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She ran off with veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to make her do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our evil pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What lady's pudding acting like a thug!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The ingredients won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They were originally\Ndelivered to Chocolatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,since Cacao Island is the\Ngateway to our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't use them all, so\Nwe still have supplies there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Press, here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Mama eliminates the Straw\NHats, lead her to Chocolatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end this matter myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How lickety-splendent of you to offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji humiliated me, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that you were\Nhiding such a beautiful eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mama can crush that insect, then\NI don't mind rewarding her with cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape for long, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart just skipped a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess some cutie was\Ntalking about me as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are, the seducing ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure we're going to be okay in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It kind of sucked last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.94,0:15:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pinky, Pink, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe keep your branches off\Nthat for a while, Lady Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but your sides will\Nstick together soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the two of us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a world of pain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,King Balm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you, tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay, Doomcoffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kingy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going straight and don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, how do you have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they took Mola's\NBeaver Card away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They thought so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out, I cut it in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This tree is swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And since he's the master of the seducing\Nwoods, he can cut a path straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, tree, head for the\Nsunny, full speed! Go, tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are like a\Nplague upon this kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My only consolation is\Nnot helping you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Adnasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not talk back to Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, targets are\Nsighted and within range.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind us! Enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Step one in, King Bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to spawn since I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You get caught and I'll\Ntear you apart at the scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Something just passed over our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that laugh already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come for my wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, near the Juice River,\Non the outskirts of Sweet City...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.46,0:18:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Juice River.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully the shark submerge\Nwill still be moored over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the whole river\Nfilled with heavy cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta try!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I find it hard to believe\Nthat the debris made it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,this far when the Whole\NCake Shit toppled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to\Nfree the shark submerge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.94,0:19:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Mom's gonna\Nreach us in a second now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she come out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get a look at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.66,0:19:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's her hunger pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my wedding cake, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, King Balm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be skewered!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spear of Elbeth shall pierce you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.80,0:20:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Elbeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...like the special\Nmove those Giants did!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, King-Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Mama, my branches are tied!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,These awful pirates are\Nforcing me to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, here she comes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kingbaum, who's that tree back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kingy, thanks, Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm worried, you're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.02,0:22:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kingy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nein, she's my tree-on-sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.98,0:22:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We were going to set up roots together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then live!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Live for her sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.86,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see her again,\Ndon't you? Fight! Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,For future I have to! Then run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're safe, you can be together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For today and tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.80,0:23:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In sweet matrimony forevermore!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Planetary!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.06,0:23:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She's diabolical.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.18,0:23:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.54,0:23:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want wedding cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's my turn! Ruby! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.44,0:23:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On my case...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I said my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Black ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.78,0:23:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning, love! Other lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.02,0:23:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bombay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, he's totally spaced out. Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to lose them in the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.72,0:24:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here with my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we reach the woods,\Nwe'll have the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have King Bound with us, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The master of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.64,0:24:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's King Bound! He's born!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.86,0:24:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, he's in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what gives!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.04,0:24:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.66,0:24:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.86,0:24:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.54,0:24:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.72,0:24:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside! Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.50,0:24:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sunny! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.48,0:24:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right to the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.82,0:25:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a straight shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.20,0:25:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so spotless!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabi, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Big Mom isn't riding\Non Zeus, we'll stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The cloud's name is Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.16,0:25:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Big Mom created him\Nfrom a piece of her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.34,0:25:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's me, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.74,0:25:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Act, Lobby is Zeus! He's here! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong, be wary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I get some more of those\Nyummy little thunder clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.64,0:25:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.55,0:25:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The black balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.92,0:25:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Were they tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.30,0:25:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they were rich and tingly\Nand went down really smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Best I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.74,0:25:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can I get some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.70,0:25:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Clouds think clouds are yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.72,0:25:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme, gimme, gimme. Pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:25:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.64,0:26:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that and let us ride you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.48,0:26:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.00,0:26:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, only Mama can because I\Ncontain part of her soul. That's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloud, you suck. Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.22,0:26:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't give us a\Nride, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.56,0:26:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you like to become my servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.74,0:26:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.96,0:26:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's talking to the Cloud, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use my blackball technique\Nto summon snacks for you every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.18,0:26:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.52,0:26:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one switching sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it was so cool when you got\Nall big and covered up the whole sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.14,0:26:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You could be the star of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.58,0:26:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama never compliments me\Nlike that or gives me snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.92,0:26:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.60,0:27:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, seducing wards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.22,0:27:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.18,0:27:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not get past to the coast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.62,0:27:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's...angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.22,0:27:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest got annoying again!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.08,0:27:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just kick the\Ntrees out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.42,0:27:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.64,0:27:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we rampage around in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,all the trees will move and we\Nwon't know where we are anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.02,0:27:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.93,0:27:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The purpose of this\Nforest is to disorient.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.84,0:28:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Mama\Noutranks my own authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.70,0:28:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming! Make me free!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.54,0:28:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.66,0:28:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your love and for your future!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.24,0:28:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Mama's orders! Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.22,0:28:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to the\NLumberyard, not today!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.84,0:28:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, team now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.58,0:28:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there! Keep pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.74,0:28:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Find something to hang on to! Tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.12,0:28:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.72,0:29:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.06,0:29:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so hot? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.54,0:29:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.84,0:29:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pickles got real big.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.16,0:29:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.62,0:29:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, King Bomb, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.30,0:29:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why did you betray Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's complicated, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.98,0:29:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.28,0:30:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.54,0:30:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we trying to crush us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.74,0:30:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, King Balm, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.42,0:30:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, King Balm!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.10,0:30:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.52,0:30:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to do it for your fiancé!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.50,0:30:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! He can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.12,0:30:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.60,0:30:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.48,0:30:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll burn you, Karoo, too! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.90,0:30:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I! I!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.54,0:31:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weee!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.54,0:31:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,King Belf, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.90,0:31:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.26,0:31:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.68,0:31:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.50,0:31:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawhead,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.16,0:31:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.07,0:31:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,my cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.26,0:31:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Betty?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.66,0:31:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch up to him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.56,0:31:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed there's a fire\Nin the seducing woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.70,0:31:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Mama is fighting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.42,0:31:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mont d 'Or, this is Barrel\Nin the Mirror World.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.60,0:31:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have 10,000 troops ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.60,0:31:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.62,0:31:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.56,0:31:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy. Biscuit. Nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.02,0:32:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare battleships from your islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.16,0:32:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And keep an eye on the southwest coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.96,0:32:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,where the Straw Hat ship is moored.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.96,0:32:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let them raise anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.70,0:32:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.02,0:32:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blockade will be the\Nfirst hurdle they face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.08,0:32:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tart ships from Flavor Island and Liqueur\NIsland will be positioned further out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.46,0:32:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready and remain\Non standby at the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.80,0:32:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in once you get a warning\Nsignal from the Territory Slugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.76,0:32:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.10,0:32:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They may have avoided the Slugs on the\Nway in, but this time they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.18,0:32:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest is noisy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.78,0:32:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.34,0:32:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama is chasing down the Straw\NHats personally, so it's unlikely,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,no, impossible that they'll make it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.88,0:32:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A safe bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, why are we setting up an ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.04,0:32:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.90,0:33:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you get the Dark tanks.\NCouldn't just let me go. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.22,0:33:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're nearly at the coast, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.80,0:33:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Banshee, stop! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.92,0:33:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.04,0:33:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, doll. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.62,0:33:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady or not, I will shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.34,0:33:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only here to talk to Chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.34,0:33:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see her immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.86,0:33:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiffon, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.50,0:33:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.41,0:33:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this about? There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.04,0:33:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a problem only you can help with.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.96,0:33:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's been hit with\Nanother hunger pang attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.76,0:33:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, she wants a wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.10,0:33:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You said a hunger pang attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.56,0:33:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, because the cake that she wants\Nhappens to be chocolate chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.22,0:33:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So you understand why I need you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.26,0:34:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.17,0:34:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my chiffon cakes are\Nthe best cakes. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.44,0:34:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And my chocolate is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.00,0:34:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we combine our talents,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.94,0:34:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we could make a cake that\Neasily satisfies Mama's craving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.06,0:34:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully before any more people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.32,0:34:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Chiffon, you must!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.06,0:34:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.72,0:34:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving this family\Njust like Lola did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be burdened by Mama anymore,\Nor worry about the people here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.64,0:34:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's done. Now go. You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.06,0:34:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.14,0:34:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about saving Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.98,0:34:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't care what\Nhappens to Toto Land either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.06,0:34:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to stop Mama before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.76,0:35:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.58,0:35:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll murder Sanji and his friends too!
